    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4774" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλφῐτ-ηρός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλφιτα, ἀγγεῖον ἀ.</span>
			<i>meal</i>-tub, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				63
			</span></i> (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τήριον</span>”
