					10.179
				</span></i>
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλφιτηρὸν ἐργαλεῖα κινεῦσι</span> 'a
			living wage for the worker', <i><span class="en">
				Herod.
				7.73
			</span></i>.</div>
